{"name":"Cronut","hex":"#d69f60","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"cronut","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A pastry which combines characteristics of a croissant and a doughnut. A croissant-based donut. A breadstuff shaped like a donut and made from croissant dough."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cronut"}],"entries":[{"title":"Cronut","blocks":[{"text":"The cronut is a doughnut-like viennoiserie filled with flavored cream and fried in grapeseed oil. The name is a portmanteau of \"croissant\" and \"doughnut\". It was developed and trademarked in 2013 by the French pastry chef Dominique Ansel in New York City."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Dominique_Ansel_Bakery_%2815900018301%29.jpg/330px-Dominique_Ansel_Bakery_%2815900018301%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cronut","wikidata":"Q14524937"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Dominique_Ansel_Bakery.jpg/500px-Dominique_Ansel_Bakery.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Dominique_Ansel_Bakery.jpg/1280px-Dominique_Ansel_Bakery.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Dominique_Ansel_Bakery.jpg/500px-Dominique_Ansel_Bakery.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Dominique Ansel Bakery, New York City","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADominique_Ansel_Bakery.jpg"}],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Fasta Pasta Gawler 20250828-130412","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Fasta_Pasta_Gawler_20250828-130412.jpg/500px-Fasta_Pasta_Gawler_20250828-130412.jpg","ratio":0.75,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fasta_Pasta_Gawler_202